        "description": {
            "value": "<p><strong>Trigger</strong> An ally you can see is reduced to 0 HP.</p><hr /><p>Though your friends might fall, you're determined to be the last one standing. Attempt a @Check[performance|dc:@self.level] check against a standard DC of your level.</p><hr /><p><strong>Critical Success</strong> You grant yourself or one ally within 30 feet of you temporary Hit Points equal to double your level. These temporary Hit Points last for 1 minute.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> As critical success, but the temporary Hit Points are equal to your level.</p>"
